'''Level 12''' was a level of the [[Trantor-class supertanker fuel depot|supertanker fuel depot]] ''[[Colossus]]''.<ref name="No Escape Part 1" /> In [[34 ABY]],<ref name="Date">{{ResistanceDate|1|20}}</ref> in an attempt to retake the ''Colossus'' from the [[First Order]] after they [[Occupation of the Colossus|took over]] the [[Supertanker fuel depot|station]], the [[Resistance]] [[spy]] [[Kazuda Xiono]] intended to swim through the [[ocean]]s of<ref name="No Escape Part 1" /> the [[planet]] [[Castilon]]<ref name="Databank">{{Databank|first-order-scuba-troopers|First Order SCUBA troopers}}</ref> to reach level 12. As he approached the level, Xiono instructed the [[Technician|mechanic]] [[Neeku Vozo]] to have its hatches open. The spy was instead forced to enter [[Level 2 (Colossus)|level 2]] after he encountered a [[Unidentified First Order SCUBA trooper 1|pair]] [[Unidentified First Order SCUBA trooper 2|of]] [[First Order SCUBA trooper]]s.<ref name="No Escape Part 1" />

==Behind the scenes==
Level 12 was mentioned in "[[No Escape: Part 1]],"<ref name="No Escape Part 1" /> the twentieth episode of the [[Star Wars Resistance Season One|first season]] of the animated television series ''[[Star Wars Resistance]]'',<ref name="Insider">{{InsiderCite|190|Resistance Revisited|''Resistance'' Revisited}}</ref> which aired on [[March 10]], [[2019]].<ref name="Disney release">{{DisneyPress|wdtv=1|url=disneychannel/shows/star-wars-resistance/episodes|text=Star Wars Resistance}}</ref>

